{
  "id": "water_service_pipe_lines",
  "title": "Water Service Pipe Lines",
  "description": "Water service pipe lines extend from the potable water source to the interior of buildings. This tool helps calculate and reference water service pipe specifications, materials, and standards.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Water Service Pipe Lines Overview\n\nA water-service pipe line extends from the potable water source to the interior of a building. Inside the building the water-service pipe becomes a water-distribution pipe.\n\n### Key Requirements\n- Rated for pressure produced by water source and service line by pumps or static differences\n- Common rating: more than 160 psi (11 bar)\n- Temperature: below approximately 75°F (25°C)\n\n### Common Materials\n- Cast iron pipe (ductile pipe) - used in large water mains\n- PE - Polyethylene\n- PVC - Polyvinyl Chloride\n- PB - Polybutylene\n- Asbestos cement pipe"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter",
          "label": "Pipe Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "operating_pressure",
          "label": "Operating Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "psi",
          "defaultValue": 160
        },
        {
          "id": "water_temperature",
          "label": "Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°F",
          "defaultValue": 70
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_material",
          "label": "Pipe Material",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "abs",
              "label": "ABS - Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene"
            },
            {
              "value": "cpvc",
              "label": "CPVC - Chlorinated Polyvinyl Chloride"
            },
            {
              "value": "copper",
              "label": "Copper or Copper-alloy"
            },
            {
              "value": "pex",
              "label": "PEX - Cross-linked Polyethylene"
            },
            {
              "value": "pe",
              "label": "PE - Polyethylene"
            },
            {
              "value": "pvc",
              "label": "PVC - Polyvinyl Chloride"
            },
            {
              "value": "pb",
              "label": "PB - Polybutylene"
            },
            {
              "value": "ductile_iron",
              "label": "Ductile Iron Pipe"
            },
            {
              "value": "galvanized_steel",
              "label": "Galvanized Steel"
            },
            {
              "value": "stainless_steel",
              "label": "Stainless Steel"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "pvc"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "pressure_rating_status",
          "label": "Pressure Rating Status",
          "formula": "inputs.operating_pressure > 160 ? 'Exceeds Standard (>160 psi)' : 'Within Standard (≤160 psi)'"
        },
        {
          "id": "temperature_rating_status",
          "label": "Temperature Rating Status",
          "formula": "inputs.water_temperature <= 75 ? 'Within Standard (≤75°F)' : 'Exceeds Standard (>75°F)'"
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter_mm",
          "label": "Pipe Diameter (mm)",
          "formula": "inputs.pipe_diameter * 25.4",
          "unit": "mm",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Piping Material",
        "US Standards",
        "Material Type"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "ABS - Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene",
          "ASTM D1527; ASTM D2282",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "CPVC - Chlorinated Polyvinyl Chloride",
          "ASTM D2846; ASTM F441; ASTM F442; CSA B137.6",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "Copper or Copper-alloy (Type K, WK, L, WL, M, WM)",
          "ASTM B75; ASTM B88; ASTM B251; ASTM B447",
          "Metal"
        ],
        [
          "PEX - Cross-linked Polyethylene",
          "ASTM F876; AWWA C904; CSA B137.5",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "PEX-AL-PEX - Cross-linked Polyethylene/Aluminum",
          "ASTM F1281; ASTM F2262; CSA B137.10",
          "Composite"
        ],
        [
          "Ductile Iron Pipe",
          "AWWA C151/A21.51; AWWA C115/A21.15",
          "Metal"
        ],
        [
          "Galvanized Steel Pipe",
          "ASTM A53",
          "Metal"
        ],
        [
          "PE - Polyethylene Plastic Pipe",
          "ASTM D2239; ASTM D3035; AWWA C901; CSA B137.11",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "PE-AL-PE - Polyethylene/Aluminum",
          "ASTM F1282; CSA B137.9",
          "Composite"
        ],
        [
          "PE-RT - Polyethylene of Raised Temperature",
          "ASTM F2769; CSA B137.18",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "PP - Polypropylene Plastic",
          "ASTM F2389; CSA B137.11",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "PVC - Polyvinyl Chloride",
          "ASTM D1785; ASTM D2241; ASTM D2672; CSA B137.3",
          "Plastic"
        ],
        [
          "Stainless Steel (Type 304/304L)",
          "ASTM A312; ASTM A778",
          "Metal"
        ],
        [
          "Stainless Steel (Type 316/316L)",
          "ASTM A312; ASTM A778",
          "Metal"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}